    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/7e6d7e5e1c88718de57884ddfd835602.webp?t=1752286364\" /></span>About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Simulation Room</i> is a high-energy 2D auto-battler with deck-building mechanics, inspired by <i>MegaMan Battle Network</i>. Master the art of combat by executing powerful program combos each turn\u2014unleash flashy attacks, upgrade your abilities, summon allies, and wield devastating weapons. Bend the battlefield to your will by altering the weather or terrain, and outsmart your enemies with cunning gadget strategies. Every move is a chance to turn the tide\u2014will you dominate the simulation or be deleted?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/5ac9d9280c6e15948e6cf20e4a50be03.poster.avif?t=1752286364\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/5ac9d9280c6e15948e6cf20e4a50be03.webm?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/5ac9d9280c6e15948e6cf20e4a50be03.mp4?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect powerful Programs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful Programs to power up your deck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/ea9122c223769b9b07426af4978ff532.poster.avif?t=1752286364\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/ea9122c223769b9b07426af4978ff532.webm?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/ea9122c223769b9b07426af4978ff532.mp4?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create devastating combo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synchronize your program  into more powerful Program or chain it in your strategic order to destroy enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/ba1b58b8510f9ecae8fbe4c99791ff5a.poster.avif?t=1752286364\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/ba1b58b8510f9ecae8fbe4c99791ff5a.webm?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/ba1b58b8510f9ecae8fbe4c99791ff5a.mp4?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle various enemies in various scenarios and environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/f6e071181c7764f56be9b57b40eace96.poster.avif?t=1752286364\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/f6e071181c7764f56be9b57b40eace96.webm?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/f6e071181c7764f56be9b57b40eace96.mp4?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/83204efdd38fa2ff0b214e1accec05a7.webp?t=1752286364\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/7e6d7e5e1c88718de57884ddfd835602.webp?t=1752286364\" /></span>About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Simulation Room</i> is a high-energy 2D auto-battler with deck-building mechanics, inspired by <i>MegaMan Battle Network</i>. Master the art of combat by executing powerful program combos each turn\u2014unleash flashy attacks, upgrade your abilities, summon allies, and wield devastating weapons. Bend the battlefield to your will by altering the weather or terrain, and outsmart your enemies with cunning gadget strategies. Every move is a chance to turn the tide\u2014will you dominate the simulation or be deleted?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/5ac9d9280c6e15948e6cf20e4a50be03.poster.avif?t=1752286364\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/5ac9d9280c6e15948e6cf20e4a50be03.webm?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/5ac9d9280c6e15948e6cf20e4a50be03.mp4?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect powerful Programs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful Programs to power up your deck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/ea9122c223769b9b07426af4978ff532.poster.avif?t=1752286364\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/ea9122c223769b9b07426af4978ff532.webm?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/ea9122c223769b9b07426af4978ff532.mp4?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create devastating combo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synchronize your program  into more powerful Program or chain it in your strategic order to destroy enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/ba1b58b8510f9ecae8fbe4c99791ff5a.poster.avif?t=1752286364\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/ba1b58b8510f9ecae8fbe4c99791ff5a.webm?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/ba1b58b8510f9ecae8fbe4c99791ff5a.mp4?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle various enemies in various scenarios and environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/f6e071181c7764f56be9b57b40eace96.poster.avif?t=1752286364\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/f6e071181c7764f56be9b57b40eace96.webm?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/f6e071181c7764f56be9b57b40eace96.mp4?t=1752286364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2297570/extras/83204efdd38fa2ff0b214e1accec05a7.webp?t=1752286364\" /